Article 192

Illegal preparation, acquisition, transportation, delivery and distribution of narcotic and psychotropic drugs, products or substances

192.1.	Illegal preparation, acquisition, transportation, delivery or distribution of narcotic drugs and psychotropic substances without intent of distribution shall be punishable by a fine equal to 101 to 150 amounts of minimum salary or by incarceration for a term of more than 3 to 6 months or imprisonment for a term of up to 2 years.

192.2.	Illegal preparation, acquisition, transportation, delivery or distribution of drugs and psychotropic substances with the intent of distribution shall be punishable by imprisonment for a term of more than 5 to 8 years.

192.3.	The same crime committed:

192.3.1.	in a large amount;

192.3.2.	involving a minor;

192.3.3.	by a recidivist;

192.3.4.	repeatedly;

192.3.5.	by a group at advance agreement, an organized group or a criminal organization shall be punishable by imprisonment for a term of more than 10 to 15 years.

